SUMMARY:20s & 30s Renaissance Festival Social
LOCATION:Parking lot\, 5 Pine S\nCarver\, MA 02330
DESCRIPTION:Saturday\, October 10\, 2026 | 11:00 AM\nhttps://activities.ou
 tdoors.org/s/oc-activity/a5UVX000001FiWP2A0/\nHear ye! Hear ye! Embraceth 
 adventure and occasions of socialization most joyous!WE'RE GOING TO THE RE
 NAISSANCE FESTIVAL\, PEASANTS!!! WOOOO-ETH!!!If you're looking at this and
  going\, "wasn't this a camping trip?" Yes\, it was. Now it's not. Rain ra
 in did not go away and in fact came those specific days. Good news\, the R
 en Fest is around for a few more weekends. Bad news\, the campground is cl
 osed for the season. So for our rain date ren-fest action\, it's just a da
 y long social.Join your fellow 20s & 30s for a Ren-Fest camp out Social on
  October 10!20s & 30s folx from any chapter are welcome to join us on this
  jaunt\, fealty to the Worcester Chapter is not a pre-requisite.Several it
 ems of note:You must secure your own ticket to King Richard's Faire\, we'r
 e not buying for you! Purchase at  www.kingrichardsfaire.net.Costumes for 
 the King Richard's Faire are encouraged but not required. If you'd like to
  borrow or need some tips\, your fearless leader is a massive nerd and can
  offer budget friendly recommendations.To best accommodate coordination\, 
 plan on being out at the fest for the whole day.
END:VEVENT
