X-MICROSOFT-MSNCALENDAR-ALLDAYEVENT:TRUE
SUMMARY:20s & 30s Squam Traverse
LOCATION:Sandwich Notch Road\nSandwich\, NH
DESCRIPTION:Sunday\, October 25\, 2026\nhttps://activities.outdoors.org/s/
 oc-activity/a5UVX000001JOcL2AW/\nJoin the Worcester 20s & 30s group for a 
 hike in the Squam Lake region on Sunday\, October 25th! We will hike the S
 quam Traverse\, an approximately 12-mile hike along the Crawford-Ridgepole
  trail. We'll summit four peaks and enjoy views from this trail along the 
 Squam Range.This hike will have approx. 2\,850 ft of elevation gain. Our i
 ntention is to go at a roughly 1.5 mile per hour pace. Expect to be on tra
 il for the full day.We intend to summit Mts Percival and Morgan\, which ar
 e both "52 With a View" hikes. This will be a one-way hike with a car spot
 . We may ask some participants to help with driving members of our group b
 etween the trailheads.Sturdy shoes with laces\, at least 2 liters of water
 \, nutritious snacks/lunch\, and appropriate layers of clothing are requir
 ed. Participants should be prepared for numerous steep ups and downs and l
 edgy and rough terrain in sections.No dogs\, please. Further details\, suc
 h as start time and location\, will be provided to participants after they
  complete the required screening form\, which will be sent after registeri
 ng. Hope to have you join us!
END:VEVENT
